// Subject: the game's damage-model view, game state only.
// The frame and dimensions of `shell.glb`, the round model beside this file
// (`rounds::effects::BodyModel`). Scene 0 places the model's tip at the origin and its body along
// +Z for `length_m`, `diameter_m` across X and Y centred on the axis; a test reads the glb's
// position bounds against these values. A round names this model by its scene path in its
// `effects.body` block, and the pen cam scales it from `diameter_m` to a record's calibre.
(
    diameter_m: (0.088, Measured("scene 0's position bounds, ±0.044 m across X and Y")),
    length_m: (0.263, Measured("scene 0's position bounds, 0 to 0.263 m along +Z")),
)
